  "item.murmol.the_astral_tome.description_0": "§3§oBound in starlit hide, etched with forgotten astral runes. ",
  "item.murmol.the_astral_tome.description_1": "§3§oTo unfold its pages is to don a shape woven from cosmic mist.",
